@Haume0 

Brightness detection was moved into OpenTUI in `1.14.24`. opencode pins OpenTUI `0.1.99`, which only supports `CSI ?997` — this breaks on terminals that don't support the sequence (kitty `0.32.2`, apt/noble ghostty, etc.).

Quick fix: clone repository, update opencode's OpenTUI dep to >=0.1.100, and rebuild. Will work as usual, with an adaptive theme.
